  message: "Fixed in PR #3825 (merged 2026-05-19). vue_component linker now imports make_file_id + make_file_stable_id from analyze.base, removes _make_component_file_id, uses canonical 'vue:{path}:1-1:file:file' for emitted file Symbols, and pre-pass existing_file_symbol_by_canonical_id ensures cross-producer dedup against orchestrator-synthesized canonicals. Three pin tests in TestInvBahovCanonicalFileIdReuse. Closes the file_id-shape identity family along with INV-ronuf (WI-hifol) and INV-movor (#3823). Vue-heavy bakeoff validation (Chatwoot, 1093 Vue component nodes) is the remaining empirical step; tagging awaits_bakeoff_validation."  # 94df
